div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"83.3\" width=\"320\" height=\"13.900000000000006\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,25.7 9.1,12.8 14.2,38.0 19.3,50.9 24.5,49.0 29.6,63.9 34.7,54.8 39.8,60.0 44.9,60.8 50.0,43.9 55.1,43.7 60.3,41.9 65.4,38.6 70.5,44.9 75.6,19.4 80.7,31.2 85.8,43.8 91.0,39.4 96.1,38.0 101.2,26.1 106.3,16.5 111.4,26.3 116.5,50.3 121.6,63.4 126.8,75.5 131.9,86.9 137.0,72.2 142.1,76.0 147.2,71.0 152.3,76.6 157.4,70.7 162.6,86.2 167.7,81.7 172.8,84.6 177.9,91.1 183.0,91.7 188.1,83.3 193.2,76.7 198.4,76.9 203.5,79.9 208.6,80.9 213.7,87.5 218.8,85.8 223.9,67.0 229.0,76.8 234.2,70.5 239.3,68.3 244.4,32.1 249.5,77.8 254.6,74.3 259.7,75.5 264.9,74.3 270.0,78.4 275.1,74.9 280.2,82.9 285.3,79.2 290.4,79.1 295.5,89.2 300.7,88.7 305.8,89.2 310.9,86.0 316.0,89.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 37.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 37.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 37.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 131.9 98.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 167.7 93.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 177.9 103.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 198.4 88.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 218.8 